<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">[//]:<sp/>#<sp/>&quot;Short<sp/>Description:<sp/>Verification<sp/>of<sp/>PLL<sp/>Frequency<sp/>using<sp/>DCC<sp/>Single<sp/>shot<sp/>mode&quot;</highlight></codeline>
